  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Policy Statement",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": null,
      "label": null,
      "heading": null,
      "section": null,
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Policy establishes the various classifications of and qualifications for a teacher license.",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": null,
      "label": null,
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy Statement",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Policy",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": null,
      "label": null,
      "heading": null,
      "section": null,
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "A teacher license shall entitle the licensee to teach in license area(s) indicated on the license.",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": "1",
      "label": "1.",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Except as provided in Section 5 below, to qualify for a teacher license, an applicant must have completed an educator preparation program at one of the following levels:",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": "2",
      "label": "2.",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Bachelor’s Degree (A – Level)",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "2(a)",
      "label": "(a)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Master’s Degree (M – Level)",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "2(b)",
      "label": "(b)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Specialist Degree (S – Level)",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "2(c)",
      "label": "(c)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Doctoral Degree (D – Level)",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "2(d)",
      "label": "(d)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "An applicant is only eligible for a license at the highest degree level at which the applicant completed an EPP; however, the applicant may qualify for graduate salary pay under LICN-006.",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": "3",
      "label": "3.",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "An applicant with a high school diploma (or equivalent) or associate’s degree (V-Level) may be issued a teaching license in the following license areas, provided the applicant meets all other requirements for the license classification sought by the application, as provided in Section 5.",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": "4",
      "label": "4.",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Career and Technical Education",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "4(a)",
      "label": "(a)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Junior Reserve Officer Training Corps",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "4(b)",
      "label": "(b)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Safety and Driver Education",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "4(c)",
      "label": "(c)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Each teacher license shall be classified as one of the following based on the applicant’s qualifications, in accordance with the corresponding rule:",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": "5",
      "label": "5.",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Initial Professional License, as provided in LICN-020.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(a)",
      "label": "(a)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Continuing Professional License, as provided in LICN-024.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(b)",
      "label": "(b)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Residency License, as provided in LICN-019.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(c)",
      "label": "(c)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Limited License, as provided in LICN-023.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(d)",
      "label": "(d)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Permit to Teach, as provided in LICN-017.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(e)",
      "label": "(e)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Emergency License, as provided in LICN-018.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(f)",
      "label": "(f)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "International Faculty License, as provided in LICN-026.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(g)",
      "label": "(g)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Lifetime License, as provided in LICN-027.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(h)",
      "label": "(h)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Provisional License, as provided in LICN-014.",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "5(i)",
      "label": "(i)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Each teacher license shall be classified as one or more of the following based on the license area(s) in which it entitles the applicant to teach:",
      "depth": 0,
      "path": "6",
      "label": "6.",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Elementary",
      "depth": 1,
      "path": "6(a)",
      "label": "(a)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Elementary (Kindergarten – Grade 6)",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(i)",
      "label": "(i)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Birth – Kindergarten",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(ii)",
      "label": "(ii)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Pre-School Add-On",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(iii)",
      "label": "(iii)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Reading (Kindergarten – Grade 6)",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(iv)",
      "label": "(iv)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Math (Kindergarten – Grade 6) Add-On",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(v)",
      "label": "(v)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Science (Kindergarten – Grade 6) Add-On",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(vi)",
      "label": "(vi)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Special Education: General Curriculum (Kindergarten – Grade 6)",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(vii)",
      "label": "(vii)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Special Education: Adapted Curriculum (Kindergarten – Grade 6)",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)(viii)",
      "label": "(viii)",
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Pre-School, Math (Kindergarten – Grade 6), and Science (Kindergarten – Grade 6) classifications shall not be issued as standalone licenses but shall only be added to an existing license consistent with LICN-013 (“Additional Teaching Areas”). The Pre-School Add-On shall only be issued to an applicant with an existing license in Elementary Education, Special Education, or Family and Consumer Sciences – General.",
      "depth": 2,
      "path": "6(a)",
      "label": null,
      "heading": null,
      "section": "Policy",
      "rows": null
    },
    {
